      <method name="announce"
              c:identifier="gtk_accessible_announce"
              version="4.14">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkaccessible.c"
             line="801">Requests the user's screen reader to announce the given message.

This kind of notification is useful for messages that
either have only a visual representation or that are not
exposed visually at all, e.g. a notification about a
successful operation.

Also, by using this API, you can ensure that the message
does not interrupts the user's current screen reader output.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtkaccessible.h" line="279"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
