           line="30">Preserves the aspect ratio of its child.

The frame can respect the aspect ratio of the child widget,
or use its own aspect ratio.

# CSS nodes

`GtkAspectFrame` uses a CSS node with name `aspectframe`.

# Accessibility

Until GTK 4.10, `GtkAspectFrame` used the [enum@Gtk.AccessibleRole.group] role.

Starting from GTK 4.12, `GtkAspectFrame` uses the [enum@Gtk.AccessibleRole.generic] role.</doc>
