        </parameters>
      </virtual-method>
      <virtual-method name="get_type_from_function">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkbuilderscope.h"
             line="58">Try to lookup a `GType` via the given function name, specified
  explicitly in a GtkBuilder file, like via the "type-func" attribute in the `&lt;object&gt;` tag.
  This function is very rarely used.
  The C implementation will use dlsym() and call the resulting function as a `GTypeFunc`.
  The default implementation will fail and just return %G_TYPE_INVALID.</doc>
