      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/deprecated/gtkcellrenderertoggle.c"
           line="36">Renders a toggle button in a cell

`GtkCellRendererToggle` renders a toggle button in a cell. The
button is drawn as a radio or a checkbutton, depending on the
`GtkCellRendererToggle:radio` property.
When activated, it emits the `GtkCellRendererToggle::toggled` signal.</doc>
      <doc-deprecated xml:space="preserve">List views use widgets to display their contents.
  You should use [class@Gtk.ToggleButton] instead</doc-deprecated>
