             filename="gtk/gtkdroptarget.c"
             line="916">Creates a new `GtkDropTarget` object.

If the drop target should support more than 1 type, pass
%G_TYPE_INVALID for @type and then call
[method@Gtk.DropTarget.set_gtypes].</doc>
