           filename="gtk/gtkfilterlistmodel.c"
           line="29">A list model that filters the elements of another model.

It hides some elements from the underlying model according to
criteria given by a `GtkFilter`.

The model can be set up to do incremental filtering, so that
filtering long lists doesn't block the UI. See
[method@Gtk.FilterListModel.set_incremental] for details.

`GtkFilterListModel` passes through sections from the underlying model.</doc>
