        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtknumericsorter.c"
             line="615">Sets the expression that is evaluated to obtain numbers from items.

Unless an expression is set on @self, the sorter will always
compare items as invalid.

The expression must have a return type that can be compared
numerically, such as %G_TYPE_INT or %G_TYPE_DOUBLE.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtknumericsorter.h" line="41"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <type name="none" c:type="void"/>
