      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkscalebutton.c"
           line="63">Provides a button which pops up a scale widget.

This kind of widget is commonly used for volume controls in multimedia
applications, and GTK provides a [class@Gtk.VolumeButton] subclass that
is tailored for this use case.

# Shortcuts and Gestures

The following signals have default keybindings:

- [signal@Gtk.ScaleButton::popup]

# CSS nodes

```
scalebutton.scale
╰── button.toggle
    ╰── &lt;icon&gt;
```

`GtkScaleButton` has a single CSS node with name scalebutton and `.scale`
style class, and contains a `button` node with a `.toggle` style class.</doc>
