                c:identifier="gtk_style_context_add_provider_for_display">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkstyleprovider.c"
             line="190">Adds a global style provider to @display, which will be used
in style construction for all `GtkStyleContexts` under @display.

GTK uses this to make styling information from `GtkSettings`
available.

Note: If both priorities are the same, A `GtkStyleProvider`
added through [method@Gtk.StyleContext.add_provider] takes
precedence over another added through this function.</doc>
