    <class name="UriLauncher"
           c:symbol-prefix="uri_launcher"
           c:type="GtkUriLauncher"
           version="4.10"
           parent="GObject.Object"
           glib:type-name="GtkUriLauncher"
           glib:get-type="gtk_uri_launcher_get_type"
           glib:type-struct="UriLauncherClass">
      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkurilauncher.c"
           line="30">Asynchronous API to open a uri with an application.

`GtkUriLauncher` collects the arguments that are needed to open the uri.

Depending on system configuration, user preferences and available APIs, this
may or may not show an app chooser dialog or launch the default application
right away.

